  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core MultiColumn ComboBox is an advanced dropdown input control that displays data in a tabular, multi-column format within the dropdown popup. It combines the simplicity of a standard ComboBox with a grid-like data presentation, enabling users to view and select records from multiple fields simultaneously. It supports local and remote data binding, filtering, sorting, custom templates, column configuration, and accessibility, making it ideal for complex data selection scenarios in forms and data-driven ASP.NET Core applications.",
